Optional PyroWave codec

Windows builds configured with SUNSHINE_ENABLE_PYROWAVE include PyroWave and
Granite (Copyright Hans-Kristian Arntzen, MIT), volk (MIT), and Vulkan-Headers
(Apache-2.0/MIT notices as distributed upstream). Exact source revisions and
complete license texts are installed in licenses/pyrowave with the optional
libpyrowave-shared-0.dll. PyroWave's embedded shader bytecode is distributed
under the same pinned project's MIT license. The Vulkan loader and GPU driver
are supplied by the operating system/driver installation, not this package.
The optional runtime includes local NT HANDLE ownership, error-path resource
cleanup fixes and an additive bundle-identity export. The exact patch and its
checksum accompany the PyroWave license; the upstream API signatures and
bitstream format are preserved.
